   "title": "Vibe coding, building for agents, and what models lack",
   "range": [
    "2025-01-01",
    "2025-12-31"
   ],
   "status": "read",
   "coverage": "All 158 posts. Dwarkesh in full; YC via his summary; four blog posts.",
